  "item_short_desc": "<p>Elevate your style with Rothco's Web Belts. Constructed from resilient high-density cotton canvas, these military belts are fully adjustable up to 54 inches. Easily customize the length by cutting for a perfect fit. The secure metal buckle ensures reliability, and the detachable buckle allows for personalized style. Measuring 1.25&rdquo; wide, these belts are versatile, fitting BDU pants, cargo shorts, uniforms, jeans, and more.</p>",
